OL,3,GNEWSAProposal to open man-made lake to
OL,4,Apublic
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been put forward to open up
OL,7,Fa man-made lake to swimmers, sailors,
OL,8,Fand scuba divers.
OL,10,FMerton Lake, near Merton, Bicester, was
OL,11,Fdug in the 1990s to provide material
OL,12,Ffor the M40 motorway, and is subject to
OL,13,Fa "change of use" application to open
OL,14,Fit up for recreational activities.
OL,16,FAccording to the plans, the Oxfordshire
OL,17,Flake, located next to the M40 in the
OL,18,Fgreen belt, has "excellent" water
OL,19,Fquality and is "ideal for scuba diving"
OL,20,Fas it is 30m (98ft) deep in places.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
